# Track what the owner decides; leave what Herdr writes as it runs out of git.
# Roles of each file: ~/.config/herdr-app/AGENTS.md, section "The files".
*
!.gitignore
!settings.json
# What every key does. Seeded on first launch, then the owner's to rebind.
!keys.json
# How programs show (name, icon, tile). Only exists once the owner writes it.
!programs.json
# Color themes the owner adds; the seeded ones are not rewritten on start.
!themes/
!themes/*.json
# Layouts the owner adds or clones (layout.clone). Herdr's own layouts are
# read-only and rewritten whole on every start, so they stay ignored.
!layouts/
!layouts/*.json
layouts/main.json
layouts/terminals.json
layouts/win98.json
# Not tracked: view.json, window.json, windows.json, shared.json, data/,
# seen.json, installed.json, icons/, frame/, mods/ (all shipped today; add a
# line for a mod the owner writes or clones), update notes, telemetry.
